        <h2 id="pseo-frameworks">PSEO Frameworks & Implementation</h2>

        <p>
          Implementing programmatic SEO requires careful planning and execution. Here's the proven framework used by companies generating millions in organic traffic:
        </p>

        <h3>Step 1: Identify Your Data Opportunity</h3>

        <p>
          The foundation of successful PSEO is finding a data set that maps to real search queries. Ask yourself:
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>What variations of my service/product do people search for?</li>
          <li>Can I access or create a database of these variations?</li>
          <li>Is there enough search volume for each variation?</li>
          <li>Can I provide unique value for each variation?</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          For example, if you run a real estate platform, your data opportunity is: <code>Property Type + Location</code>. 
          This creates combinations like "3 bedroom apartments in Seattle," "condos for sale in Miami," etc.
        </p>

